        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十一月十日清晨，印第安韦尔斯年终总决赛小组赛。第一次站上这个舞台，安德烈娃怎样把六次危机全部守住？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e0f5337fab223be67ab97963a2c379e577a35377d197a667ca3e88abeb6d3592",
      "words_sha256": "c6b78fe8b41ea74c49808b00f7b83f57b3ad111b929d9f4220ab937e4732227b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a3a7382dca9bd0c5c56a5b3565efc634012da660091d27a0860d5bcdb606bea3",
      "request_id": "a3a7382dca9bd0c5c56a5b3565efc634012da660091d27a0860d5bcdb606bea3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "67fbebc89f3b6465987fb91ebca28241",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一局，四个破发点全部化解。对手的机会过去了，这一次，轮到安德烈娃拿赛点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
